    "background_story": "Carlos was a brilliant and eccentric inventor who lived in a small, cluttered cottage. His most prized possession was an old, mysterious cupboard that had been passed down through his family for generations. Legend had it that the cupboard held secrets and inspiration for those who dared to explore its depths. Carlos spent most of his days rummaging through the cupboard's shelves, uncovering strange gadgets, dusty tomes, and cryptic notes. One day, while exploring the cupboard, Carlos stumbled upon an obscure blueprint that led him to create a revolutionary new material. His discovery made him a renowned figure in the scientific community, and he credited the cupboard as the source of his inspiration. Carlos's love for the cupboard became a defining characteristic, and he continued to uncover its secrets, unlocking new innovations and wonders.",
